~ whats_your_deal
Flynn: So... how about you? 
Nike: Hm?
Flynn: Like... Why are you so...
Nike: Careful how you finish that sentence, buckaroo.
Flynn: Hah! 
Flynn: Man, yeah I dunno, this is gonna sound weird, but like perfect?
Nike: Phfah! 
Flynn: No! Not like *that*! Like don't get me wrong you look great and you're super cool, but like.. Ew! ...
Flynn: Oh god that's not like an *ew* ew, I just don't like guys, you know? 
Flynn: But that's not implying that you're all the way a guy I just... oh fuck me.
Nike: Haha-- Keep on digging your grave, buddy, I believe in you-- hahaha!
Flynn: ... I'm done now
Nike: Oh come on, you're fine! That was the best laugh I've had in a hot second!
Flynn: Glad to see my social ineptitude is doing something other than lose me friends.
Nike: Aw, buddy. 
Nike: Come on, go ahead and tell me what were you gonna say before, I'm curious.
Flynn: ... I dunno.
Flynn: It just feels like you've got everything figured out. 
Flynn: Like you're just there for your people. Always. Even when they may not want that.
Nike: *Especially* when they might not want that.
Flynn: Haha-- Fair enough; I appreciate that. Really, I do. 
Nike: But?
Flynn: But... you never need anything like that yourself. 
Flynn: Maybe you do and you just don't say anything about it.
Flynn: I dunno. I'm just a huge fucking mess at any given time and you're just ...
Nike: I'm not perfect flynn. Not even close.
Flynn: Then why...
Nike: I ... Don't know. 
Nike: I just feel better when helping other people? 
Nike: I don't need to put more shit on them when they're already going through it.
Flynn: So you're just.. Alone... with your problems?
Nike: I can deal with my problems alone. Like I have my whole fucking life. 
Nike: Everyone else needs support more than me and my stupid f-fucking problems do. Fuck.
Flynn: Nike... Are you ok?
Nike: Ah... Fuck, uhh-- I .. Um.. Do.. Do me a favor and f-forget I said anything, yeah?
Flynn: God, nike i'm so sorry I didn't ask earlier. Do you-- want a hug?
Nike: Gahh.. no.. Nope. Nuh uh. You can't see me like this, sorry, I'm gonna go bathroom real quick
- Hug them as they pass
- 
=> END

